---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
permalink: /contact/
description: "Contact composer Frank La Rocca for commissions, performances, and press."
---
<figure class="page-banner"><img src="/images/bayeux-cathedral.jpg" alt="The nave of Bayeux Cathedral" width="1760" height="540" loading="eager"><figcaption>Bayeux Cathedral. Photograph by Frank La Rocca.</figcaption></figure>
<h1>Contact</h1>
<div class="two-up">
  <div>
    <form class="form" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.contactEmail }}" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="franklarocca.com contact">
      <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/contact/?sent=1">
      <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      <label>Your name<input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label>
      <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></label>
      <label>Subject<input type="text" name="subject"></label>
      <label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="7" required></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send</button>
      <p class="note sent" hidden>Thank you. Your message has been sent.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:0">Performance materials</h2>
    <p><em>Mass of the Americas</em> and works published by Lumen Verum Music: <a href="mailto:{{ site.materialsEmail }}">{{ site.materialsEmail }}</a></p>
    <p class="note">Directors: see <a href="/directors/">For directors</a> for perusal scores and publishers.</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Press and media</h2>
    <p>{{ site.pressAddress }}<br>{{ site.pressPhone }}</p>
    <p class="note"><a href="/press-kit/">Press kit</a> with biography and photographs.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<script>if(location.search.indexOf('sent=1')>-1){var s=document.querySelector('.sent');s.hidden=false;s.scrollIntoView();}</script>
